## Bottom Line

`host-screen-contracts` has credible real business value because it solves the pre-wrapper evidence gap. It gives teams a deterministic way to move from "we have a valuable host transaction on screens" to "we have a reviewable, replayable, privacy-aware, drift-aware API contract candidate." That is a high-ROI wedge because it reduces uncertainty before expensive modernization work starts.

